From fd5b3c2e65f6610aec194a26978be82f72e84c12 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Remora <remora@local>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 19:59:50 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Remora: add AOSP 17's `purpose` to the remaining Lineage info
 preferences
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

AOSP 17 made `purpose` an abstract member of PreferenceMetadata, so every
AOSP-16-era Lineage preference class fails kotlinc until it declares one. Three
remained after 9006:

  LineageVersionDetailPreference
  LineageBuildDatePreference
  LineageVendorSecurityPatchLevelPreference

Found by scanning every Lineage-authored Kotlin class implementing
PreferenceMetadata for the members AOSP 17 now requires, rather than waiting for
the compiler to surface them one build at a time — each build cycle costs ~12
minutes to reach Settings, and these three would otherwise have taken three.

All are read-only info rows (PreferenceSummaryProvider, no value type) so only
`purpose` is missing; none needs supportsWrite or the availability pair. Each
reuses its own title, which already states exactly what the row shows, and which
is an already-translated lineageos.platform.internal resource — a purpose string
invented here would not be translated in any locale. Same reasoning as
LineageLegalPreference and DarkModeBlackThemePreference.

Change-Id: I4a069ba3966cfef2fb85c951621523945823f2ec
---
 .../firmwareversion/LineageBuildDatePreference.kt         | 8 ++++++++
 .../LineageVendorSecurityPatchLevelPreference.kt          | 8 ++++++++
 .../firmwareversion/LineageVersionDetailPreference.kt     | 8 ++++++++
 3 files changed, 24 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/com/android/settings/deviceinfo/firmwareversion/LineageBuildDatePreference.kt b/src/com/android/settings/deviceinfo/firmwareversion/LineageBuildDatePreference.kt
index 191afa5bb9c..8555f6a0bf8 100644
--- a/src/com/android/settings/deviceinfo/firmwareversion/LineageBuildDatePreference.kt
+++ b/src/com/android/settings/deviceinfo/firmwareversion/LineageBuildDatePreference.kt
@@ -33,6 +33,14 @@ class LineageBuildDatePreference :
     override val title: Int
         get() = org.lineageos.platform.internal.R.string.build_date
 
+    // Remora forward-port note: AOSP 17 made `purpose` an abstract member of PreferenceMetadata,
+    // so this AOSP-16-era class no longer satisfies the interface. These are read-only info rows
+    // whose title already states exactly what they show, and the title is a lineageos.platform
+    // resource that is translated — a new purpose string would not be. Reusing the title matches
+    // sibling LineageLegalPreference.
+    override val purpose: Int
+        get() = org.lineageos.platform.internal.R.string.build_date
+
     override fun bind(preference: Preference, metadata: PreferenceMetadata) {
         super.bind(preference, metadata)
         preference.isSelectable = false
